Subject: [PATCH] Test dragon egg exclusion from End portal duplication

Cover every registered falling block with the option on and off, reject dragon egg snapshots in both directions and after state changes, and preserve existing continuation safety tests.

diff --git a/src/test/java/io/papermc/paper/porting/EndPortalContinuationTest.java b/src/test/java/io/papermc/paper/porting/EndPortalContinuationTest.java
index 08f98aef6ac3a3db32bf2eb53fa9baa221598ced..13c4a276d98b163048048796e92d1c01f90c0ad0 100644
--- a/src/test/java/io/papermc/paper/porting/EndPortalContinuationTest.java
+++ b/src/test/java/io/papermc/paper/porting/EndPortalContinuationTest.java
@@ -1,12 +1,20 @@
